Purpose: stress the Phase 7 inherited forwarding network without adding RTL.
Memory model: instruction memory has 1-cycle read latency; data memory is unused.

Checks:
1. Repeated writes to x1 verify EX/MEM forwarding has priority over an older MEM/WB match.
2. add x3 and add x4 consume two forwarded operands in adjacent cycles.
3. addi x0 followed by add x6 confirms x0 writes are not forwarded.
4. beq consumes forwarded branch operands and flushes the wrong-path addi x9=99.
5. jalr consumes a forwarded base register, writes link x13=0x40, and flushes two wrong-path instructions.

Expected output:
x1=00000008 x2=00000007 x3=0000000f x4=00000017 x5=00000014 x6=00000014
x7=0000000b x8=0000000b x9=00000009 x12=00000048 x13=00000040
x14=0000000e x15=0000000f x17=0000001d
